    {
      "id": "u_9fabe18368328ad3fb5681a5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium comes with a large set of custom hooks for Preact, all of which are also available to custom widgets and __TRILIUM_PH_0__Render Note__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "9fabe18368328ad3fb5681a57b09ebb4a5d461265929642320d7e8d88d911ed8",
      "context": "Hooks > Custom hooks",
      "contextHash": "02e1a117fd138774a458b5008218cfe2f43390319e1de96b28aef295b5e89224",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Trilium には Preact 用の多数のカスタムフックが付属しており、これらはすべてカスタムウィジェットおよび __TRILIUM_PH_0__ノートのレンダリング__TRILIUM_PH_1__でも利用できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e86de00f4bbeba41afab9e15_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "As a replacement to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note context aware widget__TRILIUM_PH_1__, Preact exposes the current note context in the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ hook:",
      "sourceHash": "e86de00f4bbeba41afab9e151520cc6d68f61786c06395611649390d030326fd",
      "context": "Hooks > Custom hooks > useNoteContext",
      "contextHash": "5a37df875bab0a6c4e0276cc3a9ed3d66adc8127469645c5dd92ec77aaeab24c",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ノートコンテキスト認識ウィジェット__TRILIUM_PH_1__の代替として、Preact は現在のノートコンテキストを __TRILIUM_PH_2__ フックで公開しています。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f00923578c996fc1c04e3609_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Note that the custom widget must be inside the content area (so note detail widget) for this to work properly, especially when dealing with splits.",
      "sourceHash": "f00923578c996fc1c04e360914bf0a3f5da066461c330cb2e1229efdef7b1261",
      "context": "Hooks > Custom hooks > useNoteContext",
      "contextHash": "5a37df875bab0a6c4e0276cc3a9ed3d66adc8127469645c5dd92ec77aaeab24c",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これが正常に機能するためには、特に分割表示を扱う場合、カスタムウィジェットがコンテンツ領域内（つまりノート詳細ウィジェット）にある必要があることに注意してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7cb12c20be8caa19e78c7e6d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ is an alternative to __TRILIUM_PH_1__ which works even if the widget is not within the note detail section and it automatically switches the note context as the user is navigating around between tabs and splits.",
      "sourceHash": "7cb12c20be8caa19e78c7e6daa999b1637361ad9da714a875190497bff285d08",
      "context": "Hooks > Custom hooks > useActiveNoteContext",
      "contextHash": "2a0601d68aee3bea25e5c46a15f8fd41996280e95788fb4c11ae3fd36c578769",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ は __TRILIUM_PH_1__ の代替であり、ウィジェットがノート詳細セクション内にない場合でも機能し、ユーザーがタブや分割表示の間を移動するにつれて自動的にノートコンテキストを切り替えます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5226d954735816f19bb31541_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This hook allows “listening” for changes to a particular property of a __TRILIUM_PH_0__, such as the __TRILIUM_PH_1__ or __TRILIUM_PH_2__ of a note. The benefit from using the hook is that it actually reacts to changes, for example if the note title or type is changed.",
      "sourceHash": "5226d954735816f19bb31541ca0be2222c361f8e55875d58b0e0e3bcb20502c1",
      "context": "Hooks > Custom hooks > useNoteProperty",
      "contextHash": "083b6c76d40a0004eaab737a53b9503be5cf6bcb22871b44f1655b56aa651832",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "このフックを使用すると、__TRILIUM_PH_0__の特定の値（ノートの__TRILIUM_PH_1__や__TRILIUM_PH_2__など）の変更を「リッスン」できます。このフックを使用する利点は、例えばノートのタイトルやタイプが変更された場合に、実際にその変更に反応できることです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
